---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import headshot from '../assets/headshot.jpg';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Joe Fazio"
  description="Joe Fazio: JMU Computer Information Systems graduate focused on mastering IT fundamentals and helping businesses stay secure."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="intro">
    <Image
      class="portrait"
      src={headshot}
      alt="Joe Fazio."
      widths={[260, 520]}
      sizes="(max-width: 34rem) 45vw, 13rem"
      loading="eager"
    />

    <div>
      <p>
        I'm Joe. I graduated from James Madison University with a degree in
        Computer Information Systems, taken through the College of Business,
        which mostly meant learning to ask what a system is <em>for</em> before
        arguing about how to build it.
      </p>

      <p>
        I want to master the fundamentals of IT and help businesses stay secure.
        Support, systems, networking, cloud, and security all build on each
        other, so I'm open to any of them. Every role teaches something that
        makes me better at the rest.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    The two things worth knowing about how I work: I am reliable and I am
    persistent. I finish what I pick up, and I stay on a problem past the point
    where it stops being interesting.
  </p>

  <h2>What I'm building</h2>

  <p>
    This site. The infrastructure is the point: Astro, Cloudflare Pages, DNS I
    manage myself, and a build in GitHub Actions that has to pass before anything
    reaches the main branch. The repository is public and every choice in it has
    a written reason attached, including the ones I got wrong and went back to
    fix. I wanted infrastructure I could explain out loud.
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro > div {
    flex: 1 1 18rem;
  }

  .intro p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .portrait {
    flex: 0 0 13rem;
    width: 13rem;
    max-width: 45%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.22);
  }

  @media (max-width: 26rem) {
    .portrait {
      max-width: 60%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
